  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "猫のヤツ",
    "nextLabel": "1010001000413"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001000410030,
    "label": "1010001000411",
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "やっぱりキャンディーがいいと思いますか！？\r\nこれ、私も気に入ってるんですよ～",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/101000100041/1010001000410030"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001000410040,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "ほらっ、可愛いですよね？\r\n……はっ、ユニットのみんなと色違いとかもいいかも！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/101000100041/1010001000410040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（よし、楽しく話せたな）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001000410050,
    "label": "1010001000412",
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "プロデューサーさん、お目が高いです！\r\nこれ、友達からプレゼントしてもらったものなんですよ",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/101000100041/1010001000410050"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001000410060,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "でも、使ってて傷がついちゃうのも嫌だから、\r\nなかなか踏み切れないんですよねぇ",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/101000100041/1010001000410060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（まぁ、普通に話せたかな）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001000410070,
    "label": "1010001000413",
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "あっ、ごめんなさい！\r\nこれはさっきまでつけてたヤツで……！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/101000100041/1010001000410070"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001000410080,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "えへへ、できたら違うのがいいかなって……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
